{"name":"A Familiar Friend, Reimagined","size":"medium","type":"Reimagined","tag":"","alignment":"lawful neutral","hitDice":"18","armorName":"natural armor","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":3,"otherArmorDesc":"17 (natural armor)","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"40","customHP":true,"customSpeed":true,"hpText":"115","speedDesc":"35 ft.","strPoints":"18","dexPoints":"18","conPoints":"14","intPoints":"12","wisPoints":"16","chaPoints":"12","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"120","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":null,"cr":"12","customCr":"10 (5,900 XP)","customProf":4,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"Once below 80 hp, Meridia will Stalking Passage away a few feet back, and utilize A God, Manufactured instantly.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"Once below 100 HP, Meridia will utilize A God, Manufactured once, no matter when in turn.","lairDescriptionEnd":"","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the aboleth's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the aboleth's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the aboleth dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Corrupted Blood (Multiattack)","desc":"??? wields an arsenal of four blood weapons at her disposal, all with different effects. \nOn her turn, ??? will roll a d4 to determine which weapon she will utilize. ??? makes three weapon attacks."},{"name":"Bloodrending Form (裂血形态)","desc":"???'s transformation progresses as the fight continues. For every five stacks obtained from Bloodrending Form (裂血形态), gain the following effects:\nReceive 2d6 more damage from attacks.\nInflict 2d6 more necrotic damage when attacking.\nProgress violet rot."}],"actions":[{"name":"Bleeding Guandao","desc":"Slash with a Bleeding Guandao, gaining one stack(s) of Bloodrending Form (裂血形态).\n(+8) to hit, 10 ft reach, one target. Inflicts 16 (2d10 + 5) Slashing damage and 8 (2d8) necrotic damage.\nIf the target is a creature, they must save a DC 18 constitution saving throw. On a fail, the victim receives full damage.\nOn a success, damage is halved."},{"name":"Bleeding Javelins","desc":"Eviscerate with Bleeding Javelins, gaining one stack of Bloodrending Form (裂血形态).\n(+9) to hit, reach 5ft, one target. Inflict 12 (2d6 + 5) slashing damage plus 7 (2d6) necrotic damage. \nIf the target is a creature, they must save a DC 18 constitution saving throw. On a fail, the victim receives full damage.\nOn a success, neither happen."},{"name":"Bleeding Daggers","desc":"Puncture with Bleeding Daggers risen from the floor, gaining two stacks of Bloodrending Form (裂血形态).\n(+8) to hit, range 160 ft, single target. Inflict 13 (2d8 + 5) piercing damage plus 8 (2d8) necrotic damage."},{"name":"Bleeding Greatsword","desc":"Slash with a Bleeding Greatsword, gaining one stack of Bloodrending Form (裂血形态).\n(+8) to hit, range of up to 120 ft, single target. Inflicts 12 (2d6 + 5) slashing damage plus 7 (2d6) necrotic damage."}],"bonusActions":[{"name":"Violet Inferno, Last Cry of  Innocence (纯真)","desc":"??? screams in agony, and engulfs herself and their surroundings in violet blood, serrating anything and everything around her in a 20ft radius.\nOne time use.\n(+8) to hit, 20 ft radius. \nInflict 23 (3d10 + 6) slashing damage plus 8 (2d8) necrotic damage to those within 10 ft. DC 17 CON save to take half damage.\nInflict 12 (2d8 + 4) slashing damage plus 7 (2d6) necrotic damage to those within 20 ft. DC 15 CON save to take half damage."}],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[{"name":"con","order":2},{"name":"int","order":3},{"name":"wis","order":4}],"skills":[],"damagetypes":[{"name":"bludgeoning","note":" (Resistant)","type":"r"},{"name":"fire","note":" (Vulnerable)","type":"v"},{"name":"necrotic","note":" (Resistant)","type":"r"}],"specialdamage":[],"conditions":[{"name":"poisoned"}],"languages":[{"name":"Abyssal","speaks":true},{"name":"Common","speaks":true}],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":2,"damage":[]}